  "notes": [
    "Initial Python suite: 346 tests, one documentation consistency error while closure links were being edited. Focused five-test recheck and final full 346-test suite passed after link correction.",
    "Linux textual snapshot initially differed only in the intended root help stdout. Reviewed update accepted; fresh normal contract comparison passed. Structured contracts passed.",
